OL,3,GNEWSABinet plays down hospital project
OL,4,Aconcerns
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe health minister has said he remains
OL,7,Fconfident the project to build an acute
OL,8,Fhospital will be finished on time and
OL,9,Fwithin budget, after politicians raised
OL,10,Fseveral concerns.
OL,12,FSenator Tom Binet signed the #710m
OL,13,Fconstruction contract for the Overdale
OL,14,Fproject with Bouygues UK days before
OL,15,FJune's general election.
OL,17,FThe head of the corporate services
OL,18,Fscrutiny panel, Deputy Lyndsay Feltham,
OL,19,Ffelt he lacked a "tangible plan" to
OL,20,Fhouse the hundreds of builders who
OL,21,Fwould come from Europe and the UK.
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,444,440,260,160,0,100
