OL,3,GNEWSABinet plays down hospital project
OL,4,Aconcerns
OL,5,
OL,6,FAs well as answering concerns about
OL,7,Ftraffic and transparency, Binet said
OL,8,Fhis department was looking at various
OL,9,Faccommodation options and that they
OL,10,F"should find a way".
